# Review ownership. Currently a single owner; once the org teams exist
# (Settings > Teams), switch the default to @q-summit/it-team and the gated
# paths to @q-summit/maintainers.
#
# Model: everyday code is team-wide; durable truth (decisions, architecture),
# governance, and the paths that can break editors or compliance have a
# stricter gate.
#
# Bootstrapping gap (documented 2026-07-23): with a solo owner, branch
# protection sets enforce_admins: false (.github/admin/setup-repo.sh), since a
# sole owner cannot approve their own pull request. That means an admin merge
# on the paths gated below skips independent review by design, not by
# accident. This must flip to org teams (@q-summit/...) before the maintainer
# set grows past one person. Until then, call out any admin-bypass merge that
# touches the gated paths in that pull request.

# Default: any maintainer can review.
*                       @LukasStrickler

# Durable truth: requires a maintainer's review.
/docs/decisions/        @LukasStrickler
/docs/architecture/     @LukasStrickler

# Sensitive code paths: CMS schema and access control changes affect every
# editor; deploy config affects the live site. Content-sync is the only
# automated remote write path (drafts only).
/apps/cms/src/collections/  @LukasStrickler
/apps/cms/src/access/       @LukasStrickler
/apps/cms/src/content-sync/ @LukasStrickler
/apps/cms/src/endpoints/    @LukasStrickler
/apps/cms/src/globals/      @LukasStrickler
/apps/cms/src/payload.config.ts @LukasStrickler

# Deploy config: the comment above says deploy config is gated, but these were
# not listed. wrangler.jsonc holds the R2 binding and run_worker_first routing
# that serve every /media/* request; astro.config.mjs sets the site URL that
# canonicals and the sitemap are built from.
/apps/web/wrangler.jsonc    @LukasStrickler
/apps/web/astro.config.mjs  @LukasStrickler

# Governance and automation: requires a maintainer's review.
/.github/               @LukasStrickler
/scripts/               @LukasStrickler
/LICENSE.md             @LukasStrickler
/LEGAL.md               @LukasStrickler
/SECURITY.md            @LukasStrickler
/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md     @LukasStrickler
/CONTRIBUTING.md        @LukasStrickler
/README.md              @LukasStrickler
